# Optional. With a key here every reader is served live data through the
# /api/data proxy and the key never reaches the browser. Without one, the
# operator can still attach a key through the hidden ?apikey= link (it is
# kept in the browser and travels as a request header to the same proxy),
# and with neither the app renders the bundled AAPL snapshot in public/data/.
FMP_API_KEY=
